sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  participant Phone as Phone / pairing tool
  participant Vac as Vacuum
  participant Web as Local HTTPS
  participant MQ as Local MQTT
  Phone->>Vac: Pair on device Wi-Fi / session-key exchange
  Phone->>Vac: Encrypted Wi-Fi + regional configuration
  Vac->>Web: TLS to configured hostname
  Web-->>Vac: Certificate matches requested hostname
  Vac->>Web: Signed region / bootstrap request
  Note over Vac,Web: Vacuum keeps its own RSA private key
  Web-->>Vac: Response encrypted for vacuum RSA public key
  Vac->>MQ: MQTT/TLS connect with configured credentials
  MQ-->>Vac: Commands / responses / events
  Note over Phone,MQ: Fresh pairing only. Already-paired devices may skip these stages
